    {
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "original": "I seen the most beautiful sunset last night, it was like the whole sky was lit up and on fire with all kinds of amazing colors like orange, pink, and purple. Me and my friend was just standing their on the old wooden dock, not saying nothing to each other, just completely silent and watching it fade slowly. The way the light reflected off the water made it look like a path of glitter leading right to the horizon, it was so pretty. It was a truly incredible site that we was lucky too witness, and it definately made me feel really peaceful and happy inside, like all my worries had just floated away for a little while. I wish I could of captured it better, but my phone's camera just don't do it no justice at all. ",
      "proofread": "I saw the most beautiful sunset last night. It was as if the whole sky was lit up and on fire with all kinds of amazing colors like orange, pink, and purple. My friend and I were just standing there on the old wooden dock, not saying anything to each other, just completely silent and watching it fade slowly. The way the light reflected off the water made it look like a path of glitter leading right to the horizon. It was so pretty. It was a truly incredible sight that we were lucky to witness, and it definitely made me feel really peaceful and happy inside, like all my worries had just floated away for a little while. I wish I could have captured it better, but my phone's camera just doesn't do it any justice at all.",
